{"seq":3,"slug":"post-quantum-cryptography","title":"后量子密码学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication/post-quantum-cryptography","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"后量子密码学\">后量子密码学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>后量子密码学（Post-Quantum Cryptography, PQC）研究能够抵抗量子计算机攻击的经典密码算法。Shor算法对RSA和椭圆曲线密码的威胁已非遥远假设——随着量子硬件的加速发展，全球密码基础设施正面临&quot;先收集后解密&quot;（harvest now, decrypt later）的现实风险，密码体系的量子安全迁移已成为各国战略优先事项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"量子威胁分析\">量子威胁分析</h3><p>Shor算法对当前主流公钥密码的影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>密码方案</th>\n<th>经典安全性</th>\n<th>量子攻击复杂度</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RSA-2048</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>112</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{112})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">112</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 多项式</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECC (P-256)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{128})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 多项式</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AES-128</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{128})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{64})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> Grover</td>\n<td>需加倍密钥长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHA-256</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{128})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 碰撞</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>85</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^{85})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">85</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仍然安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对称密码和哈希函数受Grover算法影响较小（仅平方根加速），加倍密钥长度即可保持安全。公钥密码则需要全面替换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"格密码-lattice-based-cryptography\">格密码（Lattice-Based Cryptography）</h3><p>格密码是NIST PQC标准化中最重要的方向，基于格上困难问题的计算复杂性。</p>\n<p><strong>基本概念</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 维格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中的离散加法子群：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}(\\mathbf{B}) = \\left\\{\\sum_{i=1}^n z_i \\mathbf{b}_i : z_i \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{B} = [\\mathbf{b}_1, \\ldots, \\mathbf{b}_n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 为格基。</p>\n<p><strong>核心困难问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最短向量问题（SVP）</strong>：找到格中最短非零向量</li>\n<li><strong>学习有误差问题（LWE）</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbf{A}, \\mathbf{b} = \\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{s} + \\mathbf{e})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7694em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">As</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，恢复秘密 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{A} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_q^{m \\times n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7252em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1544em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随机，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{s} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_q^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.072em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为秘密，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 为小高斯噪声。</p>\n<p>LWE的困难性可以归约到最坏情况格问题，这是格密码安全性的理论基础。</p>\n<p><strong>NIST标准算法</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>ML-KEM（原CRYSTALS-Kyber）</strong>—密钥封装：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于Module-LWE问题</li>\n<li>密钥大小：800-1568 bytes</li>\n<li>密文大小：768-1568 bytes</li>\n<li>安全级别：128/192/256 bit</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ML-DSA（原CRYSTALS-Dilithium）</strong>—数字签名：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于Module-LWE和Module-SIS</li>\n<li>签名大小：2420-4595 bytes</li>\n<li>公钥大小：1312-2592 bytes</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"基于哈希的签名\">基于哈希的签名</h3><p>哈希签名方案的安全性仅依赖于哈希函数的安全性，是最保守的PQC候选。</p>\n<p><strong>SPHINCS+（SLH-DSA）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无状态哈希签名</li>\n<li>安全性仅假设哈希函数抗原像</li>\n<li>签名较大（~17KB-50KB）但安全假设最少</li>\n<li>适合作为&quot;备份方案&quot;（hedging strategy）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>XMSS和LMS</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有状态哈希签名（更小的签名）</li>\n<li>要求严格维护状态计数器（不能重复使用密钥）</li>\n<li>已被NIST SP 800-208批准用于特定场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"其他pqc方向\">其他PQC方向</h3><p><strong>基于编码的密码</strong>（Code-Based）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>代表：Classic McEliece（NIST候选）</li>\n<li>基于随机线性码解码问题</li>\n<li>公钥极大（~260KB-1MB）但密文小且加解密快</li>\n<li>安全假设历史悠久（1978年McEliece系统）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>基于多变量多项式</strong>（Multivariate）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>求解多变量二次方程组（MQ问题）</li>\n<li>签名小且验证快</li>\n<li>公钥较大</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>基于同源映射</strong>（Isogeny-Based）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于椭圆曲线同源问题</li>\n<li>SIKE方案在2022年被经典攻击攻破</li>\n<li>新方案（如SQIsign）仍在研究中，密钥和签名非常紧凑</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"nist标准化进程\">NIST标准化进程</h3><p>NIST PQC标准化于2016年启动，经过多轮筛选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间线</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2016</td>\n<td>征集提案（82个候选）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>第二轮（26个）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>第三轮（7+8个）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>FIPS 203/204/205发布（ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-26</td>\n<td>第4轮附加签名标准（HQC等）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"量子安全迁移\">量子安全迁移</h3><p>迁移的紧迫性来自&quot;Y2Q&quot;（Years to Quantum）估计和数据保密期限的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>migration</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>quantum</mtext></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>现在就必须行动</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{if } T_{\\text{harvest}} + T_{\\text{migration}} &gt; T_{\\text{quantum}} \\Rightarrow \\text{现在就必须行动}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">migration</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quantum</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现在就必须行动</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>混合方案</strong>（Hybrid）：在过渡期同时使用经典和PQC算法，确保即使PQC方案被攻破，经典方案仍提供保护：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>KDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>classical</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>PQC</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{final}} = \\text{KDF}(K_{\\text{classical}} \\| K_{\\text{PQC}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">classical</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PQC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>迁移优先级</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>长期保密数据（政府/医疗/金融）→ 立即迁移</li>\n<li>TLS/VPN通信 → 部署混合方案</li>\n<li>代码签名/固件更新 → 过渡到PQC签名</li>\n<li>身份认证 → 最后阶段</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;量子威胁评估&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;资产盘点与分类&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;算法选择&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;混合部署&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;测试与验证&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;全面迁移&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;监控与更新&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;加密: ML-KEM&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;签名: ML-DSA&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;备份: SLH-DSA&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"量子威胁评估\"] --&gt; B[\"资产盘点与分类\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"算法选择\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"混合部署\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"测试与验证\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"全面迁移\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"监控与更新\"]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"加密: ML-KEM\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"签名: ML-DSA\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"备份: SLH-DSA\"]</pre><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年后量子密码学的重要进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NIST标准正式生效</strong>：FIPS 203（ML-KEM）、204（ML-DSA）、205（SLH-DSA）已于2024年正式发布，主要云服务商和操作系统完成集成</li>\n<li><strong>Chrome/Firefox PQC部署</strong>：Google Chrome默认启用ML-KEM+X25519混合密钥交换，Firefox跟进支持</li>\n<li><strong>量子安全TLS 1.3</strong>：IETF完成了PQC密钥交换和认证的RFC草案，混合方案进入实验性部署</li>\n<li><strong>NIST第4轮签名</strong>：HQC（基于编码）被选为额外KEM标准；新的签名候选（如MAYO, CROSS）进入深入评估</li>\n<li><strong>格密码参数调整</strong>：在对抗新型格攻击（如BKZ 2.0改进）的安全分析中，部分参数集进行了保守调整</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>计算题</strong>：对于LWE问题参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3329</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=3329</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3329</span></span></span></span></span>，高斯噪声标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma=3.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.2</span></span></span></span></span>，估计蛮力攻击的复杂度（提示：考虑格中最短向量长度与噪声幅度的关系）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>对比题</strong>：列表比较ML-KEM、Classic McEliece和NTRU在公钥大小、密文大小、计算速度和安全假设方面的差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>设计题</strong>：描述一个混合TLS握手协议，同时使用ECDH和ML-KEM进行密钥交换。密钥如何组合？为什么需要混合而不是直接切换？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思考题</strong>：如果未来发现格问题存在多项式时间量子算法（类似Shor对因数分解），PQC还有哪些&quot;最后防线&quot;？从安全假设的多样性角度讨论。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>后量子密码学为量子计算威胁提供了经典密码学的解决方案。格密码（ML-KEM/ML-DSA）凭借效率和成熟度成为NIST标准的核心选择，哈希签名（SLH-DSA）提供了最保守的安全保障。全球密码基础设施的量子安全迁移已经启动——这不是一个是否需要迁移的问题，而是如何在保持系统可用性的前提下尽快完成迁移的工程挑战。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后量子密码学","id":"后量子密码学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"量子威胁分析","id":"量子威胁分析"},{"level":3,"text":"格密码（Lattice-Based Cryptography）","id":"格密码-lattice-based-cryptography"},{"level":3,"text":"基于哈希的签名","id":"基于哈希的签名"},{"level":3,"text":"其他PQC方向","id":"其他pqc方向"},{"level":3,"text":"NIST标准化进程","id":"nist标准化进程"},{"level":3,"text":"量子安全迁移","id":"量子安全迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"量子网络与量子中继","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication/quantum-network"},"next":{"title":"量子精密测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-applications/quantum-sensing"}}